PHP-Realpad-Takeout for Debian
===============================

PHP Autoloader
--------------

This package ships a static autoloader that registers the library's classes and
populates `Composer\InstalledVersions` so other installed PHP packages can detect it.

Classes are installed in: `/usr/share/php/RealpadTakeout`
Autoloader: `/usr/share/php/RealpadTakeout/autoload.php`

To use in your PHP code:

```php
require_once '/usr/share/php/RealpadTakeout/autoload.php';
```

**Note:** This package NO LONGER ships `vendor/autoload.php` from Composer.
Use the Debian autoloader instead for proper system integration.

Installation
------------

For Debian, Ubuntu & friends please use repo:

```shell
sudo apt install lsb-release wget
echo "deb http://repo.vitexsoftware.cz $(lsb_release -sc) main" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/vitexsoftware.list
sudo wget -O /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/vitexsoftware.gpg http://repo.vitexsoftware.cz/keyring.gpg
sudo apt update
sudo apt install PHP-Realpad-Takeout
```

Migration from Composer vendor/autoload.php
--------------------------------------------

If you're migrating from Composer's autoloader, replace:

```php
require_once __DIR__ . '/../vendor/autoload.php';
```

with:

```php
require_once '/usr/share/php/RealpadTakeout/autoload.php';
```

This ensures you're using the system-wide Debian packages instead of bundled dependencies.

